      <h1>
        Spin the Wheel for <em>Remote Teams</em>: Decision Making &amp;
        <em>Collaboration</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        A working playbook for the specific friction of remote meetings — where
        a wheel actually helps, where it doesn't, and exactly how distributed
        teams are using it in 2026.
      </p>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <span class="meta-dot">·</span>
        <span>✅ Updated November 24, 2026</span>
        <span class="meta-dot">·</span>
